        {
          "role": "user",
          "senderName": "阿青",
          "text": "const result = users.find(x => x.id === id); console.log(result.name);"
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "senderName": "阿青",
          "text": "大肥鱼，这行报 Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'name')，什么原因，怎么改？给能用的代码"
        }
      ],
      "replies": {
        "X": "`find` 没找到就返回 `undefined`，你再 `.name` 当然炸了。加个判空：\n\n```js\nconst result = users.find(x => x.id === id);\nif (result) {\n  console.log(result.name);\n}\n```\n\n要是找不到也想打印点啥：\n\n```js\nconst result = users.find(x => x.id === id);\nconsole.log(result?.name ?? '没找到这个人');\n```",
        "Y": "find 没找到就返回 undefined，你直接点 .name 就炸了。改法：\n\n```js\nconst result = users.find(x => x.id === id);\nconsole.log(result?.name);\n```\n\n想兜底就给个默认值：\n\n```js\nconst result = users.find(x => x.id === id) ?? { name: '查无此人' };\nconsole.log(result.name);\n```\n\n不过 id 类型对不上也会找不到，比如一个是字符串一个是数字，先确认下这个。"
      }
    },
